 data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">|</mo></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">‖</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">‖</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
